Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:13.45,0:00:17.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是讲一个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:17.82,0:00:21.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了救快要废社的篮球社
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:21.56,0:00:25.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而努力的新任老师的故事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:25.63,0:00:28.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家好 我是波多野
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:28.66,0:00:32.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天开始当你们的老师
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:32.70,0:00:36.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会努力
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:37.24,0:00:40.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟大家互相信任
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:41.04,0:00:45.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像母子一样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:46.51,0:00:49.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彼此信赖
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:52.75,0:00:54.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:55.02,0:00:58.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要充满梦想的生活吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:02.73,0:01:04.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:05.13,0:01:09.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要燃烧青春的生活吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:10.07,0:01:11.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:11.71,0:01:15.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我一起歌颂学生生活吧!
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:33.86,0:01:35.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(新老师波多野结衣)
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:13.60,0:03:15.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用痴女技巧锻炼肉棒的女老师
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:18.20,0:03:21.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位\N(当老师第一天)
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:22.07,0:03:24.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是我重要的学生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:24.84,0:03:27.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会...\N老师 可以了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:33.41,0:03:37.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这份相遇是非常....\N够了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:39.92,0:03:42.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:42.79,0:03:47.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要好好...\N让我们走
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:47.20,0:03:50.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放我们走
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:51.00,0:03:54.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放我们走
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:54.84,0:03:58.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放我们走 够了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:03.31,0:04:08.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正我们快废社了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:08.18,0:04:10.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:10.39,0:04:15.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们篮球社啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:15.29,0:04:20.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有这5人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:20.23,0:04:25.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本打不了比赛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:25.63,0:04:30.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,5人都上场啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:30.44,0:04:33.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:33.34,0:04:36.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有烦恼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:36.68,0:04:40.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正又赢不了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:41.42,0:04:45.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没干劲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:45.75,0:04:50.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉又很累
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:50.19,0:04:52.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没兴趣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:53.90,0:04:58.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不想练习
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:58.03,0:05:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:00.97,0:05:05.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正赢不了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:05.37,0:05:07.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:09.01,0:05:13.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:15.38,0:05:17.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 我懂了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:18.75,0:05:22.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老师懂了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:22.86,0:05:27.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会给你们很棒的东西
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:33.53,0:05:36.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:36.37,0:05:39.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会自慰吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:40.51,0:05:45.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:46.31,0:05:50.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好老师知道的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:50.55,0:05:52.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的问题就是自慰过度
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:54.62,0:05:58.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才没有这么频繁咧\N对吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:59.59,0:06:04.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顶多每天一次啊\N不自慰怎么睡啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:07.60,0:06:11.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天开始
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:11.47,0:06:14.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,禁止自慰
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:14.68,0:06:17.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来管理你们的射精
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:18.48,0:06:21.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么鬼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:21.38,0:06:23.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:24.79,0:06:28.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么鬼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:29.72,0:06:34.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:34.10,0:06:37.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老师说什么啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:43.54,0:06:47.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以吧\N是...
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:47.88,0:06:51.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真乖
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:51.21,0:06:55.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那拜托啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:55.82,0:06:59.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太扯了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:00.42,0:07:03.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天开始
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:03.99,0:07:06.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由我管理
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:07.33,0:07:11.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赢了比赛就纶你们奖励
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:13.10,0:07:17.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奖励就是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:18.07,0:07:21.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟老师无套做爱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:22.94,0:07:27.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无套做爱?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:28.02,0:07:31.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:31.62,0:07:33.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(所以....)
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:16.66,0:08:20.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,田中 早啊，
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:22.94,0:08:26.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,田中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:32.91,0:08:36.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老师\N怎么啦?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:36.55,0:08:39.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老师
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:39.82,0:08:43.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没睡好啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:43.86,0:08:48.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天一直朱眠
