Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:08.62,0:09:12.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是没打所以睡不好吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:14.22,0:09:16.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那老师我...
